.TH SPP-POLYGLOT 1 "2026-05-31" "SPP Framework" "SPP Polyglot Engine"
.SH NAME
spp-polyglot \- Multi-language interoperability daemon and bridge
.SH DESCRIPTION
The SPP Polyglot Engine bridges PHP with foreign runtimes including Python, Java, C++, .NET, Perl, Node.js, and Go.
.SH FEATURES
.B Daemon Mode
Runs background socket workers that maintain state and provide instant execution without language bootstrapping overhead.

.B Ephemeral Mode
Spawns one-off processes for executing CLI operations via standard JSON I/O.

.B Developer Perspective
All libraries, scripts, and dispatchers live strictly in 'spp/lib/polyglot' to maintain framework isolation.

.B Layman Perspective
Polyglot translates messages between languages! Write complex AI models in Python and access them from PHP like normal PHP functions.
